      "message": "Please add a much more thorough description of this reset time logic to the commit message. It also seems like there are unrelated changes in here that should probably be in a separate patch.\n\nIs all of this really android-specific? If it is fixing a problem introduced by another android-specific patch, please add a \"Fixes\" tag to the commit message citing the patch that introduced the issue. If this is fixing an upstream issue, then please submit the patch upstream.",
      "revId": "d775897b5a1d358ffd2e0b84f55be3a5ec5e96a2",
